教室から見上げた空
The sky I looked up at from the classroom,

370
01:13:11,132 --> 01:13:14,012
四角い窓枠の向こう
beyond the square window frame...

371
01:13:14,012 --> 01:13:16,912
太陽に負けない ヒカリ探そうよ
let's search for a light that won't lose to the sun!

372
01:13:16,912 --> 01:13:19,552
○や×じゃ測れないさ
You can't measure it with circles and crosses,

373
01:13:19,552 --> 01:13:22,372
答え合わせはいらない
we don't need to check answers.

374
01:13:22,372 --> 01:13:24,972
正解のない日々さ ただ楽しもうよ
In these days without correct answers, let's just enjoy ourselves!

375
01:13:24,972 --> 01:13:27,592
ノートの片隅 描かれた落書き
Scribbles drawn in the corner of the notebook,

376
01:13:27,592 --> 01:13:30,272
現実に戻る瞬間を まあ、待ってる
waiting, well, for the moment we return to reality.

377
01:13:30,272 --> 01:13:32,932
はみ出すよ 小さな自分を
Break out of your small self,

378
01:13:32,932 --> 01:13:35,732
響かした声で仲間を引き寄せて
draw friends close with a resounding voice!

379
