381
01:13:41,592 --> 01:13:44,632
チャイムに区切らせるな
Don't let the chime divide us,

382
01:13:44,632 --> 01:13:47,392
僕らの信じる夢は…無限だから
because the dream we believe in is... infinite!

383
01:13:47,392 --> 01:13:49,892
くよくよ失敗 はらはら心配よりか期待に期待に
Rather than dwelling on failures and nervously worrying, let's turn expectations into hopes,

384
01:13:49,892 --> 01:13:52,892
ネガティブな感情 消しゴムで消そうよ
let's erase negative emotions with an eraser!

385
01:13:52,892 --> 01:13:55,572
クラス分けじゃ離れないさ 同じハートのヤツとは
We won't be separated by class divisions, connected with those of the same heart,

386
01:13:55,572 --> 01:13:58,332
つながっている めいっぱい頑張り合おうよ
let's do our absolute best together!

387
01:13:58,332 --> 01:14:00,832
グラウンドの白線 踏み越えるみたいに
Like stepping over the white line of the ground,

388
01:14:00,832 --> 01:14:03,772
流した涙も 乗り越えてみせたいんだ
we want to overcome even the tears we've shed!

389
01:14:03,772 --> 01:14:06,412
はみ出すよ 今日の自分を
Break out of today's self,

390
01:14:06,412 --> 01:14:09,192
革命は誰もルーティン壊し起こした
revolution is what anyone creates by breaking routine!

391
01:14:09,192 --> 01:14:11,912
今 飛ぶよ 輝く未来
Now, let's fly into a shining future,

392
01:14:11,912 --> 01:14:14,812
追い越せそうな元気バラまき 笑い合って
scattering energy that can overtake anything and smiling together!

393
01:14:14,812 --> 01:14:17,612
遅刻はしない、約束
I promise I won't be late,

394
01:14:17,612 --> 01:14:20,732
僕らの追う夢は…永遠だけど
though the dream we're chasing is... eternal!

395
